#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Toffoli gate**\n"
msgstr "**gate Toffoli**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Toffoli gate, also known as the double controlled-NOT gate (CCX), has two control qubits and one target. It applies a NOT to the target only when both controls are in state $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr "Gate Toffoli, juga dikenali sebagai gate double controlled-NOT (CCX), mempunyai dua qubit kawalan dan satu sasaran. Ia menggunakan NOT kepada sasaran hanya apabila kedua-dua kawalan berada dalam keadaan $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Toffoli gate with the Hadamard gate is a universal gate set for quantum computing.\n"
msgstr "Gate Toffoli dengan gate Hadamard merupakan set gate universal untuk pengkomputeran quantum.\n"

