#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Identity gate**\n"
msgstr "**gate identiti**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The identity gate (sometimes called the Id or the I gate) is actually the absence of a gate. It ensures that nothing is applied to a qubit for one unit of gate time.\n"
msgstr "Gate identiti (kadangkala dipanggil gate Id atau I) sebenarnya adalah ketiadaan gate. Ia memastikan tiada apa yang digunakan pada qubit untuk satu unit masa gate.\n"

