#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**T gate**\n"
msgstr "**gate T**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The T gate is equivalent to RZ for the angle $\\pi/4$. Fault-tolerant quantum computers will compile all quantum programs down to just the T gate and its inverse, as well as the Clifford gates.\n"
msgstr "Gate T bersamaan dengan RZ untuk sudut $\\pi/4$. Komputer quantum tahan kesalahan akan mengkompil semua program quantum kepada hanya gate T dan inversnya, serta gate Clifford.\n"

