#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**S gate**\n"
msgstr "**gate S**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The S gate applies a phase of $i$ to the $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ state. It is equivalent to RZ for the angle $\\pi/2$. Note that S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"
msgstr "Gate S menggunakan fasa $i$ kepada keadaan $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$. Ia bersamaan dengan RZ untuk sudut $\\pi/2$. Perhatikan bahawa S=P($\\pi/2$).\n"

