#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In IBM Quantum Composer, the default value for `angle` is $\\pi/2$. Therefore, this is the angle used in the q-sphere visualization.\n"
msgstr "Dalam IBM Quantum Composer, nilai lalai untuk `angle` ialah $\\pi/2$. Oleh itu, inilah sudut yang digunakan dalam visualisasi q-sphere.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Non-unitary operators and modifiers {#non-unitary-operators-and-modifiers}"
msgstr "Pengendali dan pengubah suai tak-uniter {#non-unitary-operators-and-modifiers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Reset operation**\n"
msgstr "**Operasi set semula**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reset operation returns a qubit to state $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$, irrespective of its state before the operation was applied. It is not a reversible operation.\n"
msgstr "Operasi set semula mengembalikan qubit kepada keadaan $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$, tanpa mengira keadaannya sebelum operasi digunakan. Ia bukan operasi yang boleh diterbalikkan.\n"

