#, no-wrap
msgid "**RXX gate**\n"
msgstr "**gate RXX**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The RXX gate implements $\\exp(-i \\theta/2 X \\otimes X)$. The Mølmer–Sørensen gate, the native gate on ion-trap systems, can be expressed as a sum of RXX gates.\n"
msgstr "Gate RXX melaksanakan $\\exp(-i \\theta/2 X \\otimes X)$. Gate Mølmer–Sørensen, gate asli pada sistem perangkap ion, boleh dinyatakan sebagai jumlah gate RXX.\n"

